<title>UK: SuedwestLB sets $750 million Eurobond due 2002.</title>
<headline>SuedwestLB sets $750 million Eurobond due 2002.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers CSFB and Goldman Sachs (joint books).</p>
<p> BORROWER   SUEDWESTLB CAPITAL MARKETS PLC</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  SUEDWESTDEUTSCHE GZ</p>
<p> AMT    $750 MLN	COUPON     **	  MATURITY    25.FEB.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    25.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+10 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	**TO BE PRICED LATER</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/GE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.625     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF DEBT ISSUANCE PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
